  "text": "TOPP2 is Eastland Generation's newest geothermal power station on the Kawerau geothermal field and, at 49 MW, twice the size of its Te Ahi O Māui station. Built from July 2023, it came online in December 2025. It is a partnership with Ngāti Tūwharetoa Geothermal Assets, which supplies the geothermal heat and runs the wells and steamfield, and the land is leased from Ngāti Tūwharetoa Holdings.",
